{"compatibility":"minor","safety_note_md":"# SafeStan Safety Note

Compatibility: minor.

Protected data: `y`.

Generated files: `model_safe.stan`, `data_safe.json`.

Changes: reordered the model block so that the parameter prior `theta ~ normal(0, 1)` appears before `theta` is used in the protected-data likelihood `y ~ normal(theta, 1)`. This preserves the same posterior/log density because the two unconditional sampling statements commute. No data changes were made; `N` remains an unprotected context input.
","model_safe_stan":"data {
  int<lower=1> N; // Number of ys, supplied by interface
  array[N] real y; // Observed values of the ys, supplied by the interface
}

parameters {
  real theta; // Probabilistic variable theta
}

model {
  // Add marginal probabiltiy density for theta
  // to the joint log probability density using
  // equivalent sampling statement
  theta ~ normal(0, 1);

  // Add conditional probability density for the ys
  // given theta to the joint log probabilty density
  // using equivalent sampling statement
  y ~ normal(theta, 1);
}

generated quantities {
  // Save the exponential of theta for analysis
  real exp_theta = exp(theta);
}
","data_safe_json":"{"N":1,"y":[1.0]}","protected_variables":["y"]}
